只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH's officially top-recommended TUI plugin — high performance, low overhead, cute pixel whale, smooth mouse interaction. One-command install via npm. / DSH 官方首推的 TUI 插件，高性能低占用，可爱像素鲸鱼，流畅鼠标交互，npm 一键安装","id":"gh:1333111893","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-TUI","slug":"ccch1mneyyy/dsh-TUI","topics":["claude-code","coding-agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","ink","react","terminal","tui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH's officially top-recommended TUI plugin — high performance, low overhead, cute pixel whale, smoo"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"th mouse interaction. One-command install via npm. / DSH 官方首推的 TUI 插件，高性能低占用，可爱像素鲸鱼，流畅鼠标交互，npm 一键安装"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# dsh-TUI"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> An interactive terminal UI for DeepSeek Harness. It ships a pixel-whale\n> header, live work status"},{"id":"p4s2","text":", streaming thinking, double-Esc time rewind, a\n> context progress bar, and a TPS gauge. Zero core c"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"hanges: it consumes only\n> DSH's public exports, and is moving from a mounted plugin to an app with "},{"id":"p4s4","text":"its\n> own entry and composition root, where DSH loads in process as the first-party\n> backend. Insta"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"ll to enable; uninstall leaves no patches behind.\nThe prompt footer hides completed goals once the t"},{"id":"p4s6","text":"urn is idle; the Todo side panel retains their history. `Ctrl+Q` folds todos while working and hides"},{"id":"p4s7","text":"/restores the idle goal/todo footer. Clicking its todo header also hides it while idle. Hiding chang"},{"id":"p4s8","text":"es only this display: a new goal/todo snapshot or session reveals it again, and `/goal clear` does n"},{"id":"p4s9","text":"splay: a new goal/todo snapshot or session reveals it again, and `/goal clear` does not clear todos."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Split diff cards give one-sided additions and deletions the full body width, without an empty opposi"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"te pane. Ordinary edits remain side by side, and mixed files choose their layout separately before f"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"olding or streaming reveal."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Compaction status stays on one line in narrow panes: phase and cancellation hints yield first, then "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"the label is shortened; elapsed time is shown only as a complete field."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Image files referenced with `@path` use the same admission and resize/conversion policy as pasted im"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ages. Adjustment notices report the stored dimensions and format; required animation conversion is r"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"efused instead of dropping frames. Mention images and staged images still share count and stored-byt"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"e limits in source order."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Panels without a verified Component identity are temporary: settings show their title and a distinct"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" number for this run. Their toggles take effect immediately without being saved, and unrelated setti"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ngs changes preserve that choice. Old `actN:panel` entries cannot be mapped safely: remove the place"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"holder and select the current panel again. Verified Components named `actN` keep their public runtim"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"e address; an explicit selection uses `component:actN:panel` in saved preferences to avoid claiming "},{"id":"p9s6","text":"an old anonymous entry."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The default reasoning-effort setting offers the current backend/model’s declared tiers, including cu"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"stom IDs. Saved values absent from that catalog stay visible and stored; while loading or unavailabl"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"e, only Auto is selectable. On DSH, Auto follows the saved `/effort` choice, then the configured eff"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ort, then the model default. Claude/Codex retain backend preferences for Auto at startup and for res"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"umed sessions; explicitly choosing Auto resets the model default. Explicit settings changes affect t"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"he next request; unsupported preferences fall back with a notice and are never forced onto a route."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Resuming a DSH session preserves its recorded reasoning effort (or its live selection when reattachi"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ng). The saved default seeds new sessions; explicit `/effort` and effort-default settings changes st"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ill apply to the current session’s next request."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **Pixel whale pet** — three startup intros, click to wake; freezes after the first task.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"# Install the CLI and this plugin globally (ships the dsh-tui command)\nnpm install -g @deepseek-ai/d"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"sh @deepseek-harness-tui/dsh-tui"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"# Start (first run auto-initializes the profile; needs pnpm)\ndsh-tui"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"# Both `dsh-tui` and the short `dst` alias start the same TUI.\ndst"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nsh\ndsh-tui migrate                # list importable counts per agent (writes nothing)\nd"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"sh-tui migrate claude-code    # import every Claude Code conversation (likewise codex / omp / zcode "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"/ grok-build)\ndsh-tui migrate codex --dry-run  # preview what would land, write nothing"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nsh"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"# once, in the dsh-tui profile directory (the SDK is an optional dependency)\ncd ~/.dsh/profiles/dsh-"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"tui && pnpm add @anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk@0.3.287\ndsh-tui --backend claude     # or pick Claude"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" in /kernel; that choice is remembered"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nsh\nnpm install -g @openai/codex@0.160.1\ndsh-tui --backend codex\ndsh-tui --backend codex"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" --resume <thread-id>"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nsh\n/plugin enable @deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-agent-team-profile"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\ntext\ndsh profile → dsh-base → dsh-TUI Cordis patch → agent preset + DSH services\n→ sess"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ion/event → Channel projection → React components → Ink/Yoga renderer → terminal"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nsh\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile\npnpm build\npnpm smoke"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]\nsh\n/plugin install /path/to/repo\n/plugin install https://github.com/exam/ple.git\n/plugi"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"n install @scope/package@1.2.3\n```"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Permissions and Security Boundary"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"> **Windows security warning:** the Windows profile defaults to `danger-full-access` with approval s"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"et to `never`, so tools have unrestricted access. Inspect and tighten the profile before starting ne"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"xt to sensitive credentials or in an untrusted repository."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"No sandbox of its own: dsh-TUI uses the active DSH profile's filesystem, shell, sandbox and approval"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" policies. Permission presets come from the DSH `permissionPresets` registry."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**Permission persistence** (all three backends): the Claude and Codex backends keep their `/permissi"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"on` picks in `~/.dsh-tui/backends/<id>/prefs.json`; the DSH pick is kept at `~/.dsh-tui/permission.j"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"son`. Every durable preset switch teaches it (picker, typed `/permission`, Shift+Tab static modes, o"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"r a switch the official command performed on its own), and a session that never customized its permi"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"ssion planes starts on the remembered preset — applied through the same official switch path. \"Never"},{"id":"p28s6","text":" customized\" is about the user: the composition writes its own default preset into every fresh sessi"},{"id":"p28s7","text":"on at creation, and those events do not count. Plan-mode transients and the experimental Auto review"},{"id":"p28s8","text":" preset (see below) are excluded, a `DSH_PERMISSION_MODE` launch pin (this run's initial permission "},{"id":"p28s9","text":"plane) outranks the file, and an identity the mounted roster no longer offers is skipped."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
